---
module: pong
func_id: paddles
---

***conformance tests***

# one-paddle-on-each-side
After the game starts, the screen shows one :Paddle: near the left edge and one :Paddle: near the right edge of the playfield.

# left-paddle-reaches-the-top-and-the-bottom
Sending `W` to :App: 50 times moves the left :Paddle: to the top bound, and the whole :Paddle: is still on the screen. Sending `S` 50 times after that moves it to the bottom bound, and the whole :Paddle: is still on the screen.

***acceptance tests***
